# Nested catalogs for nix.hayweb.org (installed at /cvmfs/<repo>/.cvmfsdirtab).
# One catalog for the Lower Store, rooted at /nix, so its marker sits beside
# store/ and var/ (ADR 0006, #44). Not /nix/store/*: a marker inside a store
# path changes the path's contents. Not /nix/store: GC deletes every entry there
# that is not a valid path, and on a union host that is the read-only branch.
/nix
/cache/*
/profiles/*/*
